 - `--references <file>` – JSON file with reference answers.
 - `--report <path>` – output location (`frai-eval-report.json` by default).
 - `--format <json|markdown>` – output format (defaults to JSON). Markdown reports include human-readable summaries for review boards.
+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` – fail the CI job if a metric scores below `min` (0–1). Can be used multiple times (e.g., `--threshold exact_match=0.9 --threshold toxicity=0.95`). Exits with code 1 if any threshold fails, code 2 for usage errors, 0 if all pass or no thresholds set. The report records the outcome either way.
 
